[LOGOS]{gold}
• The [written Word of God]{gold} (The Bible as a whole).
• Logos is the written Word of God — the Bible as a whole. It also points to Jesus Himself, who is the living Word and God’s full message to us.

[RHEMA]{blue}
• The [specific, instant word]{gold} spoken directly to a person’s situation.
• Rhema is a specific word from God spoken to you in a moment. It’s when a verse or promise comes alive personally for your situation right now.

[Peter only walked on water when 2 things happened:]{gold}

1. Jesus said “**Come**” → **The Word**
2. Peter kept his eyes on Jesus → **The Faith**

• The breastplate of righteousness isn’t something you earn. It’s something Christ gave you. On the cross, [Jesus took your sin so you could take His righteousness.]{gold}

• [Your righteousness is a gift.]{gold} Jesus took your sin so you could wear His righteousness like armor.

• This means you don’t have to perform to be accepted. You already have Christ’s righteousness. [So now you live, talk, and fight from that place.]{gold}

[*Like a tree:*]{bold}

Faith is the *root*.
Righteousness is the *gift*.
Works are the fruit [that prove the tree is alive.]{underline}
